  "verification_notes": [
    "IMG_5320, IMG_5321, IMG_5322, IMG_5323, IMG_5344, and IMG_5345 are six new single-open reward results. Each screen contains three cards totaling 7 relics (1 + 5 + 1), for 42 visible relics in total.",
