    "No 'Star Up!' or 'Hatched!' label appears in any of the six new screens, so no star-rank or ownership change is recorded. Verified ownership remains 37 dragons.",
    "Every new screen displays exact post-award relic counters. The latest exact counters are Solstryker 68/500, Bevlorin 109/500, Arulix 62/500, Velar 158/180, Shadowrend 240/300, Zivern 329/800, Shimmer 436/800, Antares 170/300, Jagadrix 555/800, Dawnseeker 198/300, and Vesper 229/300.",
    "IMG_5320 displays Bevlorin twice in the same result: x5 at 102/500 followed by x1 at 103/500. This directly demonstrates that duplicate same-dragon cards can appear in one reward result and that the UI presents running post-card progression rather than repeating one final total on every card.",
    "The Shimmer sequence is internally consistent across new screens: 430/800 after x1 in IMG_5323, 435/800 after x5 in IMG_5344, then 436/800 after x1 in IMG_5345.",
    "The Arulix sequence is 61/500 after x1 in IMG_5321, then 62/500 after x1 in IMG_5344. Shadowrend similarly advances 239/300 in IMG_5321 to 240/300 in IMG_5322.",
